def sub1(old,new):
    global t; assert t.count(old)==1,(old[:60],t.count(old)); t=t.replace(old,new)
sub1("Participant grouping forgave nothing to the easier evaluation much of this literature uses (section 3.6); age and sex matching set aside every recording that could not be pair-matched after age alone was measured to classify Pittsburgh at 0.707 (section 5.2); the corpus-compatibility rule declined a pooling measured to manufacture performance (section 3.2.1); the lock permanently excluded a known improvement, the pause and timing measures (section 6.2); the age-residualisation technique that scored 0.853 on development data was discarded when age proved recoverable from the supposedly age-free features at R² = 0.994 (section 5.8); the external corpus could be spent once, and was (section 3.9); and fifteen claims were tested, did not survive, and are reported in full (section 5.8). Two disciplines keep that list from congratulating itself: this work tested its own favourite version of the argument and declines it, since ungrouped folds inflate nothing on this model class (section 3.6.1), and section 5.1.1 concedes that the whole modelling apparatus buys about 4.5 points of AUC over one hand-countable quantity.",
     "Participant grouping forgave nothing to the easier evaluation much of this literature uses (section 3.6); age and sex matching set aside every recording that could not be pair-matched (section 5.2); the corpus-compatibility rule declined a pooling measured to manufacture performance (section 3.2.1); the lock permanently excluded the pause and timing measures (section 6.2); an age-residualisation technique that scored 0.853 on development data was discarded when age proved recoverable from the supposedly age-free features (section 5.8); the external corpus could be spent once, and was (section 3.9); and fifteen claims were tested, did not survive, and are reported in full (section 5.8). Two disciplines keep that list from congratulating itself: ungrouped folds were found to inflate nothing on this model class, so no such claim is made against the literature (section 3.6.1), and section 5.1.1 concedes that the whole modelling apparatus buys about 4.5 points of AUC over one hand-countable quantity.")
sub1("The failure mode is this project's most transferable lesson: every defect this work found in its own analysis, artwork and deployment was silent — a tokenisation filter differing from the committed extractor, a label rule taking the first row in file order, bootstrap intervals 1.09 to 1.31 times too narrow, a stimulus missing two of the units scored against it, nine of sixty-four features silently median-imputed on every machine the installer configured. Not one raised an error, because each component met its contract — return a number — while the number's meaning had changed; a component whose contract is to return a value cannot report that the value has stopped meaning what it meant, so something outside it must (sections 3.10 and 4.5.1).",
     "The failure mode is this project's most transferable lesson: every defect this work found in its own analysis, artwork and deployment was silent — none raised an error, because each component met its contract, return a number, while the number's meaning had changed — and a component whose contract is to return a value cannot report that the value has stopped meaning what it meant, so something outside it must (sections 3.10 and 4.5.1).")
sub1("Candidate corpora for the last stage were checked for provenance. TAUKADIAL — 169 participants and 507 picture-description recordings in Mandarin and English, targeting mild impairment, whose English arm even uses the standard kitchen-scene stimulus — is not clean until checked, because that arm is a University of Delaware community cohort recruited under the same programme as the Delaware corpus in this project's training pool, so its English participant identifiers would have to be checked against the 291 Delaware training participants and any overlap removed, or the evaluation restricted to the Mandarin arm, a different language and therefore a different claim [1]. The Framingham Heart Study voice archive — digitally recorded neuropsychological examinations linked to clinically adjudicated dementia outcomes, independent of DementiaBank — would need a diarisation stage the pipeline does not have, and access runs through formal application and committee review [2]. ADReSS and ADReSSo are excluded, because ADReSS is, in its organisers' words, \"a curated subset of DementiaBank's Pitt Corpus, matched for age and gender\": evaluating a model trained on all 548 Pittsburgh recordings against it would be direct test-set contamination, and ADReSSo draws on the same pool [3].",
     "Candidate corpora for the last stage were checked for provenance. TAUKADIAL — 169 participants and 507 picture-description recordings in Mandarin and English, targeting mild impairment — is not clean until checked, because its English arm is a University of Delaware community cohort recruited under the same programme as this project's Delaware training corpus, so its participant identifiers would have to be checked against the 291 Delaware training participants, or the evaluation restricted to the Mandarin arm, a different claim [1]. The Framingham Heart Study voice archive, independent of DementiaBank and linked to clinically adjudicated outcomes, would need a diarisation stage the pipeline does not have [2]. ADReSS and ADReSSo are excluded, because ADReSS is a curated subset of the Pittsburgh corpus this model was trained on, so evaluating against it would be direct test-set contamination [3].")
sub1("The evidence is a documented search, not a systematic review, and it brackets the gap from both sides: DementiaBank lists English, German, Greek, Korean, Mandarin, Spanish and Taiwanese sections and no Arabic; a survey of the field names twelve datasets, none of them Arabic [2]; the newest benchmark for early cognitive impairment is British English only, named by its authors as a limitation [4]; the one Arabic dataset with both classes — the 24-speaker collection this project's acoustic pilot used — elicits Montreal Cognitive Assessment subtest responses, word lists rather than connected speech [5]; a systematic review of cognitive assessment for Arabic speakers, 154 studies, found no connected-speech instrument among the validated ones [6]; and Arabic connected speech exists in quantity in speech-recognition corpora that carry no clinical labels. Data with both classes and no connected speech; connected speech with no labels; never the join. A search returning both halves and never the intersection is far stronger evidence of a missing join than a search returning nothing, and the claim is falsifiable: one counterexample retires it, and that would be good news.",
     "The evidence is a documented search, not a systematic review, and it brackets the gap from both sides: DementiaBank lists seven language sections and no Arabic; a survey of the field names twelve datasets, none Arabic [2]; the newest benchmark for early cognitive impairment is British English only [4]; the one Arabic dataset with both classes — the 24-speaker collection this project's acoustic pilot used — elicits word lists rather than connected speech [5]; a systematic review of cognitive assessment for Arabic speakers, 154 studies, found no connected-speech instrument among the validated ones [6]; and Arabic connected speech exists in quantity in speech-recognition corpora that carry no clinical labels. Data with both classes and no connected speech; connected speech with no labels; never the join — and the claim is falsifiable, since one counterexample retires it.")
sub1("What the measurement saved exceeds what it cost. It arrived before 240 Libyan participants were recruited against a marker that cannot detect what the study most needs to screen for; had the Arabic study run to the earlier specification — a single-task picture-description corpus sized for the referential index — it would have returned a correctly powered null that was uninterpretable, because a single-task, single-language study cannot distinguish a wrong marker from a wrong task from a wrong implementation. The English probes separate all three (sections 5.27 and 5.25), and the finding changed what the corpus must contain — both genres from every speaker.",
     "What the measurement saved exceeds what it cost: it arrived before 240 Libyan participants were recruited against a marker that cannot detect what the study most needs to screen for, and a single-task, single-language study would have returned a correctly powered null that was uninterpretable, unable to distinguish a wrong marker from a wrong task from a wrong implementation. The English probes separate all three (sections 5.27 and 5.25), and the finding changed what the corpus must contain — both genres from every speaker.")
sub1("The lock that made one external number mean something, and cost three results to enforce. The fifteen negative results, three of which changed a design decision and two of which removed arguments this thesis would otherwise have made. The pre-registration discipline, with its four disclosed failures and the working rules derived from them. The reconciliation of every figure that has ever held more than one value. The measurement that the Arabic instrument addresses dementia rather than the target the future study most needs — made before two hundred and forty people were recruited against it. None of that is accuracy, and all of it is what makes the accuracy readable; a number without those things is the field's present situation — more than a decade of reported performance above ninety per cent, a minority of studies reporting statistical significance, and no tool in routine clinical use (section 2.3).",
     "The lock that made one external number mean something. The fifteen negative results, three of which changed a design decision. The pre-registration discipline, with its four disclosed failures and the rules derived from them. The measurement that the Arabic instrument addresses dementia rather than the target the future study most needs — made before two hundred and forty people were recruited against it. None of that is accuracy, and all of it is what makes the accuracy readable; a number without those things is the field's present situation — more than a decade of reported performance above ninety per cent and no tool in routine clinical use (section 2.3).")
sub1("What the pilot delivers is deliberately modest — battery feasibility with elderly Libyan participants, the first Libyan healthy normative distributions, validation of the Arabic word lists against dialect actually spoken, a provisional control-referenced threshold reported at its exact interval width, the elicitation-administration measurements no existing corpus records, and the pre-registered stimulus-equivalence check of the substituted picture — and it cannot test discrimination: at 20 per group it detects only a true AUC of 0.748 or larger, above every effect this project has measured, and the protocol says so in its own words.",
     "What the pilot delivers is deliberately modest — battery feasibility, the first Libyan healthy normative distributions, validation of the Arabic word lists against dialect actually spoken, a provisional control-referenced threshold at its exact interval width, the elicitation measurements no existing corpus records, and the stimulus-equivalence check — and it cannot test discrimination: at 20 per group it detects only a true AUC of 0.748 or larger, above every effect this project has measured.")
